Z||000000||varnster||08-28-2001||06:40 PM||||In need of new brakes, is the ocelot cross drilled rotor package the fiero store carries<BR>a good setup? I have been price checking and<BR>the bendex brakes and rotors are about 90 bucks cheaper, what do you guys think? I dont want to have to modify at all that is why I went with these. thanks curtis. ||||reg||5
